            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "The ENSO cycle broadly influences the precipitation patterns globally, including those of the continental United States (CONUS) (Straus and Shukla 2002; Dai and Wigley 2000; Hoerling et al. 1997; Ropelewski and Halpert 1986, 1987; Mo and Livezey 1986).",
